sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant Android
    participant Discovery as Bonjour / NSD
    participant Mac
    participant Pairing as Pairing Manager
    participant Security as Authentication
    participant Session as WebSocket Session

    Android->>Discovery: Discover available Macs
    Discovery-->>Android: Return advertised devices
    Android->>Mac: Request pairing
    Mac->>Pairing: Generate pairing challenge
    Pairing-->>Android: QR / one-time code
    Android->>Pairing: Confirm pairing
    Pairing->>Security: Validate credentials
    Security->>Session: Establish secure session
    Session-->>Android: Connected
    Session-->>Mac: Authenticated device

    loop Active session
        Android->>Session: Input event / heartbeat
        Session-->>Mac: Validated input
        Mac-->>Session: Acknowledgement / status
    end

    alt Connection interruption
        Session-->>Android: Connection failure
        Android->>Discovery: Attempt rediscovery
        Discovery-->>Android: Mac available
        Android->>Session: Reconnect and authenticate
    else User disconnects
        Android->>Session: Disconnect
        Session->>Mac: Release all held inputs
        Session-->>Android: Session closed
    end

